  "contract": "Geode 804002 adds 34.9% generic Spell Power and 8.5% Attack Power; the physical hit grants five Rage (50 internal units) to its caster. The coefficient probes query a creature, so the normal Primalist class tuning 887019 (-15% at level 60+) multiplies them: 100 AP adds 8 or 9 before tuning and 7 or 8 after truncation (1014 x 0.85 = 861, 1023 x 0.85 = 869); 23 SP adds floor(23 x 0.349) = 8 before tuning and 7 after it (1022 x 0.85 = 868). The Rage cast still targets the enemy player."
